# mm.stdio test target

Exercises the portable console through a host stand-in: partial writes when the
far end will not take everything, a read with nothing waiting, connection
reporting, the lifecycle, and the linkable fallback an unserved lane gets.

platform.cpp is that stand-in. It is a console with a bounded far end rather
than a mock of one, which is what lets a test ask what a caller sees when the
other side stops reading.
